title: Make forward-agent-log delivery failures retryable and bound live transcript input
updated_at: "2026-07-15T05:20:33Z"
---
Prevent forward-agent-log from silently losing classified events after broker delivery reports an error. Acceptance: JSONL and OpenCode paths retain/retry unsent events with bounded retry/backoff and surface a terminal/actionable failure; no line/message is marked consumed until successful delivery or an explicit documented loss policy; bound raw line/pending-buffer and complete-message sizes to avoid memory exhaustion from malformed live transcripts; add regression tests for failed then successful delivery and oversized partial input.